WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.429 --> 00:00:02.530
Hi, Mystery Recapped here.

00:00:02.530 --> 00:00:09.230
Today I am going to explain a South Korean
fantasy film called “Vanishing Time: A Boy

00:00:09.230 --> 00:00:10.230
Who Returned.”

00:00:10.230 --> 00:00:12.140
Spoilers ahead!

00:00:12.140 --> 00:00:18.060
Watch out and take care!

00:00:18.060 --> 00:00:23.150
At the start of the movie, a child psychiatrist
interviews a girl named Soo-rin.

00:00:23.150 --> 00:00:28.370
Soo-rin gets visibly nervous when the doctor
sets up a camera to record the interview.

00:00:28.370 --> 00:00:31.690
She asks her to recite her story from the
beginning.

00:00:31.690 --> 00:00:36.640
Soo-rin starts by saying that her mother married
Do-kyun some years ago.

00:00:36.640 --> 00:00:41.590
Soon after the marriage, her mother passed
away and since then, Soo-rin has been living

00:00:41.590 --> 00:00:42.590
with Do-kyun.

00:00:42.590 --> 00:00:48.400
He is appointed to a construction site on
a ruler island named Hwano, so the two have

00:00:48.400 --> 00:00:49.890
to move to the island.

00:00:49.890 --> 00:00:54.469
After her mother’s death, Soo-rin has never
truly been happy.

00:00:54.469 --> 00:00:57.969
She doesn’t talk much and isn’t fond of
her stepfather.

00:00:57.969 --> 00:01:02.700
She is enrolled in a new school on the island
where she has the opportunity to make many

00:01:02.700 --> 00:01:06.020
friends, but even then she prefers staying
alone.

00:01:06.020 --> 00:01:10.780
Her stepfather has to work overnight as the
chief of a tunnel construction site.

00:01:10.780 --> 00:01:14.680
Because of the explosions that take place
during the construction, the inhabitants of

00:01:14.680 --> 00:01:18.420
the island are forbidden from entering the
construction area.

00:01:18.420 --> 00:01:24.380
One night, Soo-rin goes through her phone
and reads comments on her blog about a wormhole.

00:01:24.380 --> 00:01:28.920
When her mother died, Soo-rin wanted to run
away from the world, and while researching

00:01:28.920 --> 00:01:34.720
ways to do that, she started to gain interest
in wormholes, supernatural beings, and so

00:01:34.720 --> 00:01:35.720
on.

00:01:35.720 --> 00:01:40.220
She talks to people on the internet about
such topics even on the school’s computer.

00:01:40.220 --> 00:01:44.759
She accidentally leaves her computer open
which allows her classmates to read her comments

00:01:44.759 --> 00:01:46.540
and make fun of her.

00:01:46.540 --> 00:01:52.450
While returning home, Soo-rin meets a boy
named Sung-min who lives in an orphanage.

00:01:52.450 --> 00:01:57.649
Sung-min introduces himself and tries to befriend
Soo-rin but she ignores him.

00:01:57.649 --> 00:02:02.920
The next day during lunch, Soo-rin comes across
Sung-min and his friends talking about her

00:02:02.920 --> 00:02:05.020
blog on the wormhole.

00:02:05.020 --> 00:02:09.399
Sung-min claims to have entered another dimension
after reading it.

00:02:09.399 --> 00:02:13.110
That day, Sung-min follows her behind as she
is walking home.

00:02:13.110 --> 00:02:17.370
On being called out, he says that he believes
everything that she has written in the blog.

00:02:17.370 --> 00:02:22.719
Out of their shared interest in supernatural
processes, the two become friends.

00:02:22.719 --> 00:02:27.030
Soo-rin has developed her own alphabets to
communicate with Sung-min in secret.

00:02:27.030 --> 00:02:31.870
They begin to use it daily to leave each other
notes in Soo-rin’s diary.

00:02:31.870 --> 00:02:36.140
Every day after school, they go around town
looking for ghosts.

00:02:36.140 --> 00:02:41.680
In one of such expeditions, Sung-min brings
Soo-rin to an abandoned wooden house in the

00:02:41.680 --> 00:02:42.680
forest.

00:02:42.680 --> 00:02:47.670
They explore the house and talk for a long
time while carving on wax blocks.

00:02:47.670 --> 00:02:51.269
Soo-rin has started to fall in love with Sung-min.

00:02:51.269 --> 00:02:54.400
She kisses him out of the blue making him
fluster.

00:02:54.400 --> 00:02:59.439
One day, Soo-rin finds Sung-min and three
of his friends planning to go to the construction

00:02:59.439 --> 00:03:01.930
site to watch the explosions.

00:03:01.930 --> 00:03:06.019
She joins them and the kids make their way
through the woods so the grownups wouldn’t

00:03:06.019 --> 00:03:07.019
see them.

00:03:07.019 --> 00:03:13.809
When they cross the fence to the site, one
of the kids chickens out and runs back home.

00:03:13.809 --> 00:03:20.760
The other four hide behind a cliff waiting,
but are disappointed when no explosions take

00:03:20.760 --> 00:03:21.930
place.

00:03:21.930 --> 00:03:25.569
While walking through the jungle, they come
across a tiny cave.

00:03:25.569 --> 00:03:29.339
They decide to explore it and go inside one
after another.

00:03:29.339 --> 00:03:34.579
Eventually, they come across a bright glowing
substance submerged in water at the end of

00:03:34.579 --> 00:03:35.699
the cave.

00:03:35.699 --> 00:03:38.249
Soo-rin assumes that it is a meteoroid.

00:03:38.249 --> 00:03:43.080
Sung-min takes it upon himself to dive into
the water and bring the substance out.

00:03:43.080 --> 00:03:46.529
On being brought out of the tunnel, the thing
stops glowing.

00:03:46.529 --> 00:03:49.349
The kids notice that it looks like an egg.

00:03:49.349 --> 00:03:57.359
One of the guys named Tae-shik claims that
the egg might belong to a time goblin.

00:03:57.359 --> 00:04:02.579
His grandfather had once told him that on
full moon nights, a cave appears in the mountains

00:04:02.579 --> 00:04:04.750
where the time goblin lives.

00:04:04.750 --> 00:04:08.760
Whoever goes into the cave will come out as
an older person.

00:04:08.760 --> 00:04:12.079
The other kids do not believe him since they
didn’t age.

00:04:12.079 --> 00:04:16.870
Soo-rin discovers that her hairpin which was
a gift from her mother is missing.

00:04:16.870 --> 00:04:21.019
She goes back into the cave to look for it
as the guys guard the egg.

00:04:21.019 --> 00:04:26.070
She finds her pin but also notices that the
glowing egg is back in the water.

00:04:26.070 --> 00:04:31.729
Confused, she comes out to see that the egg
has broken and her friends are missing.

00:04:31.729 --> 00:04:35.509
She looks for them all around the jungle till
it gets dark.

00:04:35.509 --> 00:04:39.259
She is eventually lost in the woods and has
to stay the night.

00:04:39.259 --> 00:04:43.449
The following day a police force looks for
the kids in the woods.

00:04:43.449 --> 00:04:46.370
Detective Ahn is made the head of the investigation.

00:04:46.370 --> 00:04:50.689
Soon, the police find Soo-rin unconscious
in the woods.

00:04:50.689 --> 00:04:53.229
Fortunately, she is alive and well.

00:04:53.229 --> 00:04:57.819
In the hospital, the detective asks her what
happened to the other guys and she tells him

00:04:57.819 --> 00:05:00.620
everything about the cave and the glowing
egg.

00:05:00.620 --> 00:05:04.080
The detective and the adults do not believe
her story.

00:05:04.080 --> 00:05:08.650
She even takes them to the jungle to show
them the cave but cannot find it.

00:05:08.650 --> 00:05:12.139
It is almost as if it disappeared after the
full moon night.

00:05:12.139 --> 00:05:17.460
Then, the detective is informed that the corpse
of one of the missing boys, Jae-wook, has

00:05:17.460 --> 00:05:21.759
been found underground on a beach 20 KM away
from the town.

00:05:21.759 --> 00:05:28.070
It is revealed that the cause of his death
was an asthma attack.

00:05:28.070 --> 00:05:33.290
Since someone had to bury him underground,
the case turns from missing person to kidnapping.

00:05:33.290 --> 00:05:37.480
Weeks pass after the incident but the other
two boys are not found.

00:05:37.480 --> 00:05:41.770
Without Sung-min, Soo-rin turns into her older
introverted self.

00:05:41.770 --> 00:05:47.469
She, too, is as confused as everyone but no
one believes her when she says the truth.

00:05:47.469 --> 00:05:50.439
One day, she hears a noise from outside her
house.

00:05:50.439 --> 00:05:53.780
On checking, she sees a man running to the
woods.

00:05:53.780 --> 00:05:57.070
She follows him behind and enters deep into
the forest.

00:05:57.070 --> 00:06:02.190
Some minutes into running, she falls to the
ground and the man also stops.

00:06:02.190 --> 00:06:07.789
He approaches her and looks at her in fascination
as Soo-rin freezes in shock.

00:06:07.789 --> 00:06:12.470
The man speaks for the first time and claims
that he is Sung-min.

00:06:12.470 --> 00:06:18.379
On hearing his name, Soo-rin comes out of
her shocked state and runs away crying.

00:06:18.379 --> 00:06:22.979
She ends up in front of Do-Kyun’s car and
hastily tells him about the man.

00:06:22.979 --> 00:06:26.780
The police are informed about the incident
and they start searching the woods to look

00:06:26.780 --> 00:06:30.389
for the man, assuming that he is the kidnapper.

00:06:30.389 --> 00:06:36.180
Detective Ahn asks Soo-rin about the man and
she reveals that he was pretending to be Sung-min.

00:06:36.180 --> 00:06:41.490
The policemen do not find the kidnapper but
they get their hands on Soo-rin’s diary

00:06:41.490 --> 00:06:44.710
that she and Sung-min used to leave notes
for each other.

00:06:44.710 --> 00:06:50.169
On seeing the pages, she is surprised because
they are filled with Sung-min’s notes.

00:06:50.169 --> 00:06:54.280
Using their code language, he has written
about everything that happened after she went

00:06:54.280 --> 00:06:56.750
into the cave to get her hairpin.

00:06:56.750 --> 00:07:02.259
The guys get curious about what is inside
the egg, so Sung-min breaks it on the ground

00:07:02.259 --> 00:07:04.330
without waiting for Soo-rin.

00:07:04.330 --> 00:07:07.419
To their disappointment, it turns out to be
empty.

00:07:07.419 --> 00:07:12.189
When Soo-rin doesn’t return for a while,
Sung-min goes inside the cave and sees that

00:07:12.189 --> 00:07:14.610
she has frozen in her place.

00:07:14.610 --> 00:07:18.860
He tries to talk to her and move her but she
doesn’t respond.

00:07:18.860 --> 00:07:23.029
Moments later, he notices a drop of water
levitating mid-air.

00:07:23.029 --> 00:07:29.219
He comes out of the cave and looks upwards
to see the birds have also frozen in the air.

00:07:29.219 --> 00:07:34.689
The boys go to the town and see that everyone,
including their families have paused.

00:07:34.689 --> 00:07:39.840
This makes them realize that time has frozen
for everyone except the three of them, meaning

00:07:39.840 --> 00:07:42.340
that they can do anything they want.

00:07:42.340 --> 00:07:45.180
For the first few days, they are on top of
the world.

00:07:45.180 --> 00:07:50.509
They eat and drink whatever they like, sleep
whenever they want to, and play around the

00:07:50.509 --> 00:07:51.879
entire day.

00:07:51.879 --> 00:07:56.210
After a month or so, they get bored so they
decide to leave the island and go to another

00:07:56.210 --> 00:08:00.870
city to see if they are actually the only
people on the earth who can move.

00:08:00.870 --> 00:08:06.660
However, their plan is spoiled when they realize
that the water in the ocean has also stopped

00:08:06.660 --> 00:08:10.180
flowing, which means that the boat will sink.

00:08:10.180 --> 00:08:14.530
Back in the present, Soo-rin registers that
the man who approached her in the woods was

00:08:14.530 --> 00:08:16.400
in fact Sung-min.

00:08:16.400 --> 00:08:21.699
She stops reading as now getting the police
away from him is her first priority.

00:08:21.699 --> 00:08:26.250
If they find him, they will surely arrest
him for being the kidnapper so she claims

00:08:26.250 --> 00:08:29.409
to have lied about seeing anyone in the jungle.

00:08:29.409 --> 00:08:33.409
The police believe her and she continues reading
the journal.

00:08:33.409 --> 00:08:37.599
Many months later, the guys start to live
inside a tent in the mall.

00:08:37.599 --> 00:08:42.760
Jae-wook’s health gets worse by the day
because he has asthma and his inhaler stops

00:08:42.760 --> 00:08:43.760
working.

00:08:43.760 --> 00:08:49.000
One night, he suffocates and slowly passes
away in front of his friends.

00:08:49.000 --> 00:08:51.790
Sung-min and Tae-shik are devastated.

00:08:51.790 --> 00:08:57.050
With a heavy heart, they bury their friend’s
corpse under the ground on a nearby beach.

00:08:57.050 --> 00:09:01.110
After dying, Jae-wook’s body also pauses
like the others.

00:09:01.110 --> 00:09:04.260
Five years pass but the world remains the
same.

00:09:04.260 --> 00:09:06.780
The guys have now grown into teenagers.

00:09:06.780 --> 00:09:12.010
Although they have been living in isolation
for so many years, they still hope that someday,

00:09:12.010 --> 00:09:14.240
the world will go back to normal.

00:09:14.240 --> 00:09:17.940
Sung-min believes that when they turn twenty,
their time will resume.

00:09:17.940 --> 00:09:21.850
They steal a little bit of money from everyone
to be rich when that happens.

00:09:21.850 --> 00:09:25.570
However, even when they turn twenty, nothing
changes.

00:09:25.570 --> 00:09:30.680
They slowly begin to lose hope and start to
live in the wooden house in the jungle.

00:09:30.680 --> 00:09:39.490
One day, the isolation gets the best of Sung-min;
he screams and yells for it all to stop.

00:09:39.490 --> 00:09:43.440
Tae-shik witnesses this from afar and loses
all hope.

00:09:43.440 --> 00:09:47.850
Some days later, Sung-min notices that the
moon’s shape is changing, meaning that the

00:09:47.850 --> 00:09:50.180
world is about to be resumed.

00:09:50.180 --> 00:09:53.660
He goes looking for Tae-shik but doesn’t
find him anywhere.

00:09:53.660 --> 00:09:58.190
He searches for him throughout the island
and eventually reaches the last cliff.

00:09:58.190 --> 00:10:03.089
There, he discovers Tae-shik’s clothes on
the ground and registers that his friend has

00:10:03.089 --> 00:10:05.880
jumped into the water to commit suicide.

00:10:05.880 --> 00:10:09.480
He also jumps behind Tae-shik as the last
resort.

00:10:09.480 --> 00:10:12.400
But at the very moment, the world resumes.

00:10:12.400 --> 00:10:16.410
He comes out of the water and is mesmerized
by the moving nature.

00:10:16.410 --> 00:10:21.310
After reading the journal, Soo-rin runs to
the wooden house and finally sees her friend.

00:10:21.310 --> 00:10:26.320
They decide to tell the story to the world
but are unsure if anyone will believe them.

00:10:26.320 --> 00:10:31.410
Meanwhile, CCTV footage shows the police that
Sung-min is in the woods.

00:10:31.410 --> 00:10:33.940
They believe he is the kidnaper.

00:10:33.940 --> 00:10:38.360
At night, Sung-min comes to Soo-rin’s room
for emotional support.

00:10:38.360 --> 00:10:42.540
Since he has been living alone for such a
long time, he is scared he will harm himself

00:10:42.540 --> 00:10:44.220
to get rid of the pain.

00:10:44.220 --> 00:10:48.850
The next day, Tae-shik’s parents arrive
at the construction site blaming Do-kyun for

00:10:48.850 --> 00:10:50.470
their kid’s disappearance.

00:10:50.470 --> 00:10:54.730
They believe that the explosion in the site
killed their son, and Soo-rin is making up

00:10:54.730 --> 00:10:57.140
stories to save her stepfather.

00:10:57.140 --> 00:11:02.709
Meanwhile, Soo-rin and Sung-min go to the
orphanage that Sung-min used to stay in.

00:11:02.709 --> 00:11:07.620
Soo-rin explains everything to the warden
and comes outside to call Sung-min.

00:11:07.620 --> 00:11:10.990
However, she is dragged away by her father
right then.

00:11:10.990 --> 00:11:16.019
Sung-min approaches his mother-like warden
and tells her everything he used to do as

00:11:16.019 --> 00:11:17.019
a kid.

00:11:17.019 --> 00:11:19.779
She is shocked but she still doesn’t believe
him.

00:11:19.779 --> 00:11:24.709
Do-kyun locks Soo-rin in her room at night
but Sung-min enters through the back door

00:11:24.709 --> 00:11:26.500
and frees her.

00:11:26.500 --> 00:11:30.089
They run away from the house to decide what
they should do next.

00:11:30.089 --> 00:11:33.170
Soo-rin remembers seeing a second egg in the
cave.

00:11:33.170 --> 00:11:38.649
She suggests she uses the egg and returns
as an adult to prove to the others that Sung-min

00:11:38.649 --> 00:11:39.839
is innocent.

00:11:39.839 --> 00:11:45.750
However, Sung-min is against the idea because
he knows how difficult it is to live in isolation.

00:11:45.750 --> 00:11:50.670
He would rather be named a kidnapper than
let her go through what he felt in the past

00:11:50.670 --> 00:11:51.670
years.

00:11:51.670 --> 00:11:56.100
Do-kyun sees that his daughter is missing
and figures she went to the wooden house after

00:11:56.100 --> 00:11:59.480
finding a picture of her and Sung-min on her
phone.

00:11:59.480 --> 00:12:04.610
He goes there at night, attacks Sung-min,
and tries to take Soo-rin back home.

00:12:04.610 --> 00:12:07.980
But Sung-min knocks him out and runs away
with her.

00:12:07.980 --> 00:12:13.329
The next day, the police investigate the wooden
house and believe that the kidnapper is manipulating

00:12:13.329 --> 00:12:16.760
Soo-rin by making her believe he is Sung-min.

00:12:16.760 --> 00:12:21.519
The news about Soo-rin’s disappearance is
on the TV so the police soon find the two.

00:12:21.519 --> 00:12:28.250
A chase ensues between them and the police
when Soo-rin turns herself in to save Sung-min.

00:12:28.250 --> 00:12:32.000
Before separating she asks him to meet her
at the cave.

00:12:32.000 --> 00:12:36.690
Detective Ahn tries to make Soo-rin understand
that the kidnaper is lying to her but she

00:12:36.690 --> 00:12:37.970
doesn’t believe him.

00:12:37.970 --> 00:12:42.790
She makes an excuse of wanting to go to the
bathroom and runs away to the cave.

00:12:42.790 --> 00:12:47.959
She brings the glowing egg out and hands it
to Sung-min but he refuses to return it to

00:12:47.959 --> 00:12:50.600
her because he doesn’t want her to use it.

00:12:50.600 --> 00:12:54.819
He is about to turn himself in and take the
blame for killing his friends.

00:12:54.819 --> 00:12:58.569
He runs away into the woods as Soo-rin follows
him.

00:12:58.569 --> 00:13:01.740
At the same time, the police arrive and chase
behind.

00:13:01.740 --> 00:13:03.730
They stop at the end of a cliff.

00:13:03.730 --> 00:13:08.630
An officer grabs Sung-min and pushes Soo-rin
off the cliff in the process.

00:13:08.630 --> 00:13:13.360
The detective helps Soo-rin but ends up hanging
off the cliff with her.

00:13:13.360 --> 00:13:18.160
Sung-min tries to save them, but before he
can, they both fall back.

00:13:18.160 --> 00:13:23.460
To save them, Sung-min breaks the egg again
and stops time.

00:13:23.460 --> 00:13:28.600
When Soo-rin wakes up a few seconds later,
she is on a beach with the detective.

00:13:28.600 --> 00:13:31.420
She realizes what Sung-min has just done.

00:13:31.420 --> 00:13:36.550
Although it has only been a moment for her,
for Sung-min it must have been another decade.

00:13:36.550 --> 00:13:38.570
She is then taken back home.

00:13:38.570 --> 00:13:43.089
While eating dinner, she apologizes to her
father for everything she has done and calls

00:13:43.089 --> 00:13:45.160
him dad for the first time.

00:13:45.160 --> 00:13:48.709
The detective comes to inquire how they survived
the fall.

00:13:48.709 --> 00:13:53.310
Soo-rin doesn’t answer but he figures out
that she was telling the truth this entire

00:13:53.310 --> 00:13:54.310
time.

00:13:54.310 --> 00:13:59.050
He suggests she give a false statement to
the media and say that the kidnapper had manipulated

00:13:59.050 --> 00:14:00.050
her.

00:14:00.050 --> 00:14:04.269
This way, the people who are accusing her
of killing her friends along with the kidnapper

00:14:04.269 --> 00:14:05.879
will be proved wrong.

00:14:05.879 --> 00:14:09.949
Soo-rin is finally done telling her story
to the psychiatrist.

00:14:09.949 --> 00:14:14.430
She is left stunned after listening to it
all and wants to write a book on it.

00:14:14.430 --> 00:14:18.339
Some months later, Soo-rin is moving to a
different city for high school.

00:14:18.339 --> 00:14:22.699
Before leaving, she meets the psychiatrist
who gives her the book which has now been

00:14:22.699 --> 00:14:26.250
published.

00:14:26.250 --> 00:14:31.540
On her way to the ferry, Soo-rin sees Sung-min
through her car window and runs to meet him

00:14:31.540 --> 00:14:33.379
but finds no one.

00:14:33.379 --> 00:14:36.879
But some time later, the two meet on the deck.

00:14:36.879 --> 00:14:39.690
The movie ends as they stare at each other.

00:14:39.690 --> 00:14:44.350
